{"id":"cpp-summary","cat":"cpp","title":"C++ 基础与多态","file":"cpp/summary.md","authors":["csview-local 示例"],"type":"qa","questions":[{"id":"cpp-summary~1","n":1,"title":"虚函数是怎么实现多态的？","doc":"cpp-summary","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":324,"html":"<p>每个含虚函数的类在编译期生成一张<strong>虚函数表 vtable</strong>，表里是函数地址；每个对象头部隐含一个 <strong>vptr</strong> 指向所属类的 vtable。</p>\n<p>调用 <code>p-&gt;f()</code> 时，编译器生成的代码是「取对象的 vptr → 在表里按固定槽位取地址 → 间接调用」。<strong>槽位在编译期确定，具体地址在运行期确定</strong>，这就是动态绑定。</p>\n<p>由此可以推出几个常考结论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>构造函数不能是虚函数：vptr 还没初始化好，无法查表。</li>\n<li><strong>析构函数应该是虚函数</strong>：否则 <code>delete basePtr</code> 只会调基类析构，派生类成员泄漏。</li>\n<li>构造 / 析构函数内部调用虚函数不会分派到派生类，因为此刻 vptr 指向的是当前正在构造的那一层。</li>\n<li>虚函数调用无法内联（除非编译器能去虚化），有间接跳转开销。</li>\n</ul>\n","toc":[],"freq":5},{"id":"cpp-summary~2","n":2,"title":"重载、重写、隐藏的区别？","doc":"cpp-summary","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":301,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>重载 overload</strong>：同一作用域内，函数名相同、参数列表不同。编译期按实参类型选，与虚函数无关。</li>\n<li><strong>重写 override</strong>：派生类覆盖基类的<strong>同签名虚函数</strong>，运行期分派。C++11 起加 <code>override</code> 关键字让编译器帮你检查签名。</li>\n<li><strong>隐藏 hide</strong>：派生类定义了同名函数（不管参数是否相同），基类同名函数<strong>全部</strong>被隐藏，不是重载。想保留基类版本要 <code>using Base::f;</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"adm adm-warning\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 2.6 17.2A2 2 0 0 0 4.3 20h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-2.8L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 16.6v.4\"/></svg><span>最容易踩的坑</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>基类 <code>virtual void f(int)</code>，派生类写成 <code>void f(double)</code>，你以为在重写，其实是隐藏 + 新函数。加上 <code>override</code> 会直接编译报错，把这个 bug 拦在编译期。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":2},{"id":"cpp-summary~3","n":3,"title":"智能指针怎么选？","doc":"cpp-summary","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":375,"html":"<ul>\n<li><code>unique_ptr</code>：独占所有权，不可拷贝只可移动，零额外开销，<strong>默认首选</strong>。</li>\n<li><code>shared_ptr</code>：引用计数共享所有权，控制块含强/弱两个计数，计数操作是原子的，有开销。</li>\n<li><code>weak_ptr</code>：不增加强计数，用 <code>lock()</code> 提升为 <code>shared_ptr</code>，专门用来<strong>打破循环引用</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"adm adm-danger\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M15.5 8.5 8.5 15.5M8.5 8.5l7 7\"/></svg><span>循环引用</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>两个对象各持对方的 <code>shared_ptr</code>，强计数永远降不到 0，双双泄漏。典型场景是父子互指、观察者与被观察者互指。解法是把「反向引用」改成 <code>weak_ptr</code>，明确谁拥有谁。</p>\n</div></div><p>另外注意：<code>shared_ptr</code> 的<strong>控制块线程安全，被管理对象不是</strong>；多线程读写同一个对象仍需自己加锁。<code>make_shared</code> 把控制块和对象合并成一次分配，比 <code>shared_ptr&lt;T&gt;(new T)</code> 少一次分配，但对象内存要等所有 <code>weak_ptr</code> 释放才归还。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":4},{"id":"cpp-summary~4","n":4,"title":"移动语义解决了什么问题？","doc":"cpp-summary","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":183,"html":"<p>拷贝一个持有堆资源的对象要重新分配并逐字节复制，而临时对象马上就要销毁，这份复制纯属浪费。移动语义把资源的<strong>所有权直接转移</strong>，把源对象置空，代价从 O(n) 降到 O(1)。</p>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"cpp\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">C++</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">19 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">class</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> Buffer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">    char</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">  data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> nullptr</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">    size_t</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    Buffer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">Buffer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#D7DBE0\"> o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">noexcept</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">        : </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">), </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">        o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> nullptr</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">      // 交出所有权，源对象必须可安全析构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">        o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">    Buffer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> operator</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">Buffer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#D7DBE0\"> o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">noexcept</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">        if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">this</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> !=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">            delete[]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">            data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">            o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> nullptr</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">; </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\">o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#BAEBE2\">size_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#C792EA;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">        return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> *</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">this</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">    ~Buffer</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">() { </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">delete[]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#C5E478\"> data_</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">};</span></span></code></pre></figure><div class=\"adm adm-tip\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\"/></svg><span>为什么要标 noexcept</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p><code>std::vector</code> 扩容时只有确认元素的移动构造是 <code>noexcept</code> 才敢用移动，否则为了异常安全会退回拷贝。漏写 <code>noexcept</code> 会让容器性能悄悄退化。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":2},{"id":"cpp-summary~5","n":5,"title":"堆和栈的区别？","doc":"cpp-summary","cat":"cpp","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":230,"html":"<ul>\n<li><strong>管理方式</strong>：栈由编译器自动分配释放，堆由程序员或智能指针管理。</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期</strong>：栈随作用域结束即回收；堆到显式释放为止。</li>\n<li><strong>分配成本</strong>：栈只是移动栈指针，几条指令；堆要走分配器，可能加锁、可能触发系统调用。</li>\n<li><strong>碎片</strong>：栈连续无碎片；堆频繁分配释放会产生外部碎片。</li>\n<li><strong>容量</strong>：栈通常几 MB，递归过深或大数组会栈溢出；堆受进程地址空间限制，大得多。</li>\n<li><strong>缓存局部性</strong>：栈上对象紧凑，命中率天然更高。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>所以性能敏感的短生命周期小对象优先放栈上，大对象或需要跨作用域存活的才放堆。</p>\n","toc":[],"freq":2}],"words":1413,"intro":""}